text My life has felt rather empty ever since.
text Ever since then, I have not talked to Ryou.
text I have kept my distance with Kyou as well.
text Even when we pass by each other in the hallway, we do not look each other in the eye.
text At first, it felt as if my chest was painfully gripped every time it happens.
text But after one month... two months have passed...
text After the summer is over, after the fall has come, and when the winter is just around the corner...
text I can no longer feel that pain in my heart.
